          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.53,
          "end": 9.84,
          "en": "that I wanna add to this app now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 13.68,
          "en": "For one, it would be nice to have some fallback message here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 16.35,
          "en": "if we have no expenses at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.35,
          "end": 17.46,
          "en": "In addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.46,
          "end": 20.49,
          "en": "I wanna show a little info message at the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.49,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "whenever we did remove an item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "which also offers us a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 28.53,
          "en": "which we can click to bring back that expense item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.53,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "in case we swiped accidentally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 33.48,
          "en": "Now, let's start with the easier thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 35.73,
          "en": "with showing that fallback message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.73,
          "end": 38.523,
          "en": "instead of showing that list, which would be empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "To do that, we can use a ternary expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "or to mix things up, add a new variable here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 48.693,
          "en": "which stores a Widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.62,
          "end": 54.153,
          "en": "which we could name mainContent or anything like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.05,
          "end": 58.26,
          "en": "And, initially, here, we could use the Center widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.26,
          "end": 60.21,
          "en": "to show some centered text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.21,
          "end": 65.21,
          "en": "where we say \"No expenses found. Start adding some!\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 69.063,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 73.713,
          "en": "And this can be a const value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 78.9,
          "en": "And we wanna replace that if we do have expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.9,
          "end": 80.7,
          "en": "So here we can add a if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.7,
          "end": 85.08,
          "en": "and check if registeredExpenses isNotEmpty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.08,
          "end": 87.93,
          "en": "another utility property offered by Dart",
