        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 92.82,
          "en": "to find out whether a list is not empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 95.82,
          "en": "And if registeredExpenses is not empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.82,
          "end": 97.86,
          "en": "we wanna overwrite mainContent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.86,
          "end": 101.343,
          "en": "and store a different value in that variable instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 106.233,
          "en": "And that different value should be this expenses list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.58,
          "end": 110.03999999999999,
          "en": "So I will grab that list and cut it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.03999999999999,
          "end": 112.413,
          "en": "and store that in mainContent instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.34,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "And now it's of course mainContent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 118.293,
          "en": "that should be output here as a child in this column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 122.46,
          "en": "Therefore, here, I see \"No expenses found,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.46,
          "end": 127.253,
          "en": "but if I add a new expense here, like 16.99,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.52,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "and maybe this is TRAVEL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 135.33,
          "en": "we see that instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.33,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "So this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 139.59,
          "en": "But now let's work on that message that should be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.59,
          "end": 142.26,
          "en": "if we dismiss an expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.26,
          "end": 145.32,
          "en": "To show a message after deleting an expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.32,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "it sounds like it would be a good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 149.04,
          "en": "to go to this removeExpense method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.04,
          "end": 152.76,
          "en": "because that is where we do remove expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.76,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "And indeed it is here after calling remove,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "where I do want to show this info message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 161.43,
          "en": "And we can show such a message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.43,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "by using another feature offered by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.16,
          "end": 167.88,
          "en": "Besides all these utilities show functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.88,
          "end": 169.74,
          "en": "which Flutter offers here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.74,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "it also offers a special object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 176.61,
          "en": "which you can use for showing or hiding certain UI elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.61,
          "end": 177.93,
          "en": "And here, that would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.93,
          "end": 182.93,
          "en": "the ScaffoldMessenger utility object which we want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.72,
          "end": 188.28,
          "en": "This ScaffoldMessenger object has a of method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.28,
          "end": 190.59,
          "en": "which we must execute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.59,
          "end": 192.66,
          "en": "which wants a context value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.66,
          "end": 195.78,
          "en": "which as you learned, is available in this class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.78,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "which is based on the State class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 199.5,
          "en": "Now this then gives us an instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.5,
          "end": 201.39,
          "en": "of this ScaffoldMessenger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.39,
          "end": 204.06,
          "en": "And this ScaffoldMessenger thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 207.51,
          "en": "offers us various utility functions and methods",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.51,
          "end": 210.63,
          "en": "that help us with controlling the user interface,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.63,
          "end": 214.47,
          "en": "and showing certain things on that interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.47,
          "end": 215.61,
          "en": "Most importantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.61,
          "end": 220.61,
          "en": "we can call showSnackBar to show a so-called snackBar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 222.21,
          "en": "which you might have not heard before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.21,
          "end": 224.64,
          "en": "but which in the end is just a info message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.64,
          "end": 226.263,
          "en": "which is shown on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.67000000000002,
          "end": 231.69,
          "en": "And showSnackBar wants a SnackBar value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.69,
          "end": 234.03,
          "en": "And this value can be created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.03,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "by using the built in SnackBar class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 239.013,
          "en": "and instantiating this class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.6,
          "end": 244.02,
          "en": "And SnackBar then needs at least a content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.02,
          "end": 246.213,
          "en": "which must be set to a Widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.26,
          "end": 252.26,
          "en": "And in most cases, this will probably be some plain text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.6,
          "end": 253.74,
          "en": "So here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.74,
          "end": 256.29,
          "en": "we could say \"Expense Deleted,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.29,
          "end": 257.763,
          "en": "because that is what we did,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 258.6,
          "end": 260.733,
          "en": "and this can be set to be const.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.5,
          "end": 264.9,
          "en": "But there is more that can be configured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 264.9,
          "end": 266.97,
          "en": "about that SnackBar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.97,
          "end": 269.7,
          "en": "For example, it also has a duration parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.7,
          "end": 273.69,
          "en": "that can be set and that wants a duration value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.69,
          "end": 275.82,
          "en": "a value of Type: Duration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.82,
          "end": 278.01,
          "en": "which can be created with the built-in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.01,
          "end": 279.81,
          "en": "Duration constructor function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.81,
          "end": 281.853,
          "en": "so the built-in duration class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.14,
          "end": 286.92,
          "en": "And this then has various parameters that can be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.92,
          "end": 289.38,
          "en": "to define a duration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 289.38,
          "end": 293.01,
          "en": "For example, we can set it to 3 seconds here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 293.01,
          "end": 296.253,
          "en": "And this can also be turned into a constant value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 298.44,
          "end": 303.33,
          "en": "And we can also add an action to our SnackBar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 303.33,
          "end": 305.79,
          "en": "So not actions, but one single action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.79,
          "end": 308.37,
          "en": "and this must be of type SnackBarAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.37,
          "end": 309.78,
          "en": "which is created by using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 309.78,
          "end": 312.36,
          "en": "the special SnackBarAction constructor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.36,
          "end": 313.763,
          "en": "so the SnackBarAction class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 316.05,
          "end": 319.89,
          "en": "And this then has also some configuration items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 319.89,
          "end": 321.36,
          "en": "some parameters we can set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 321.36,
          "end": 324.72,
          "en": "like for example, the label, which does not want a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 324.72,
          "end": 327.21,
          "en": "but a plain string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 327.21,
          "end": 328.68,
          "en": "For example, Undo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 328.68,
          "end": 331.68,
          "en": "so that we have a button on that info message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 331.68,
          "end": 335.763,
          "en": "that allows us to bring back that deleted expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 336.65999999999997,
          "end": 340.56,
          "en": "And we then also have to add the onPressed parameter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.56,
          "end": 343.08,
          "en": "to define the function that should be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 343.08,
          "end": 346.863,
          "en": "if this Undo button is pressed on this SnackBar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 348,
          "end": 353,
          "en": "And in here, I then want to call setState to update the UI,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 353.94,
          "end": 355.923,
          "en": "and change registeredExpenses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 357.78,
          "end": 359.52,
          "en": "and instead of removing something,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 359.52,
          "end": 361.74,
          "en": "here, I wanna add something again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 361.74,
          "end": 365.25,
          "en": "However, actually not with the add method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 365.25,
          "end": 367.2,
          "en": "but instead with the insert method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 367.2,
          "end": 369.48,
          "en": "which also adds an item to a list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 369.48,
          "end": 373.38,
          "en": "but we add our item to a list at a specific position,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 373.38,
          "end": 376.05,
          "en": "because I of course wanna bring back that expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 376.05,
          "end": 379.32,
          "en": "that we removed in exactly the same place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 379.32,
          "end": 380.913,
          "en": "where it was before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 381.81,
          "end": 383.97,
          "en": "Now for that, we first of all need to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 383.97,
          "end": 385.89,
          "en": "where this expense was",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 385.89,
          "end": 387.29,
          "en": "by getting the expenseIndex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 388.14,
          "end": 390.72,
          "en": "because insert wants the index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 390.72,
          "end": 392.61,
          "en": "where the element should be added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 392.61,
          "end": 395.253,
          "en": "and then the element that should be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 396.3,
          "end": 398.82,
          "en": "So we first of all need to find out which index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 398.82,
          "end": 400.95,
          "en": "this expense that we removed had,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 400.95,
          "end": 403.44,
          "en": "and for that, of course, before removing it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 403.44,
          "end": 405.9,
          "en": "we need to get that index.",
          "zh": ""
        },
